# Load the first entry through the game's normal menu, then stop all input.
# Warm-start route with shorter waits; this is not a memory snapshot. The destination follows your save list.
# The host starts this script only after shader preparation. Cold/new builds may need longer waits.
mark first-save-start
wait 10000
tap x 150
wait 1500
tap x 150
wait 1500
tap x 150
wait 20000
mark first-save-ready
